The vendored material is the curriculum (levels, lesson text, fixtures, and the
bash handbook). The upstream Python Rich terminal engine (engine/*.py, play.sh)
is not included. Play, hints, and grading are implemented in this repository.
Learner scripts run in the browser with just-bash (Apache-2.0) and are not
sent to a server.
